    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ex_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -274
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Rose curve\n\nCurve in `rose` mode traces a rose: n petals for an odd n, twice as many for an even one (the slider), and a `d` above 1 gives roses that take several turns to close. Each of its 900 points gets a dot: a Linear spread of hues, drifting with Time, runs twice round the colour wheel along the curve, and a Sine Spread ripples the dot sizes. An LFO turns `phase`, so the petals slowly rotate.\n\nTry Curve's other modes: lissajous, hypotrochoid (Spirograph), star, superformula.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 210
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Rose curve\n\nCurve in `rose` mode traces a rose: n petals for an odd n, twice as many for an even one (the slider), and a `d` above 1 gives roses that take several turns to close. Each of its 900 points gets a dot: a Linear spread of hues, drifting with Time, runs twice round the colour wheel along the curve, and a Sine Spread ripples the dot sizes. An LFO turns `phase`, so the petals slowly rotate.\n\nTry Curve's other modes: lissajous, hypotrochoid (Spirograph), star, superformula.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 210
      }
    },
